Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:55.73,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}用盡全力去期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.07,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}自由的BAD GIRL
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:58.42,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}故作頑皮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.12,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}失常般狂笑 哦啦哦啦哦啦哦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:02.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}懶散的BAD GIRL
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.19,0:20:03.23,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}傷感笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:05.23,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}可不許小看我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.75,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4}放馬過來吧
